<section class="travel-start" aria-labelledby="travel-start-title">
  <div class="travel-start-inner">
    <div class="travel-start-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">EMPIEZA AQUÍ</p>
        <h2 id="travel-start-title">¿Qué buscas hoy?</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        No necesitas tener el viaje claro. Empieza por lo que tienes en la cabeza y deja
        que el atlas haga el resto.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="travel-start-grid" aria-label="Formas de empezar a explorar">
      <a class="travel-start-card" href="#explorador" data-travel-start="search">
        <span class="travel-start-number">01</span>
        <span class="travel-start-copy">
          <strong>Tengo un destino en mente</strong>
          <small>Busca por destino, país, región o continente.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="travel-start-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>

      <a class="travel-start-card" href="#radar">
        <span class="travel-start-number">02</span>
        <span class="travel-start-copy">
          <strong>Quiero descubrir</strong>
          <small>Empieza por un lugar que te despierte curiosidad y sigue el hilo.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="travel-start-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>

      <a class="travel-start-card" href="#radar">
        <span class="travel-start-number">03</span>
        <span class="travel-start-copy">
          <strong>Quiero inspiración</strong>
          <small>Déjate llevar por una primera selección y sigue la curiosidad.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="travel-start-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.travel-start{padding:0 2rem 6rem;background:var(--color-papel)}
.travel-start-inner{width:min(var(--content-width),100%);margin:0 auto;padding:3.5rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(28,48,38,.12)}
.travel-start-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,.55fr);gap:5rem;align-items:end}
.travel-start-intro h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-bosque);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em}
.travel-start-intro>p{margin:0;color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75}
.travel-start-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:2.5rem}
.travel-start-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1rem;align-items:end;min-height:170px;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid rgba(28,48,38,.12);border-radius:18px;background:#f7f4ef;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.travel-start-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(194,125,56,.65);background:var(--color-papel);box-shadow:0 14px 35px rgba(28,48,38,.07)}
.travel-start-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-cobre);outline-offset:3px}
.travel-start-number{align-self:start;color:var(--color-cobre);font-size:.66rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px}
.travel-start-copy{min-width:0}
.travel-start-copy strong{display:block;color:var(--color-bosque);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.08}
.travel-start-copy small{display:block;max-width:260px;margin-top:.6rem;color:#666;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.55}
.travel-start-arrow{color:var(--color-cobre);font-size:1.05rem;transition:transform .2s ease}
.travel-start-card:hover .travel-start-arrow{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
@media(max-width:900px){.travel-start{padding:0 1.5rem 5rem}.travel-start-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.travel-start-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.travel-start-card:last-child{grid-column:1 / -1}}
@media(max-width:600px){.travel-start-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.travel-start-card:last-child{grid-column:auto}.travel-start-card{min-height:145px}}
</style>
